---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Sabrina The RMT handles website privacy, email, text messages, Jane booking links and optional Google Maps."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="shell content-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
      <h1>A simple, privacy-conscious website</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">
        This website is designed to collect as little information as possible.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="shell content-narrow prose">
      <h2>Information collected on this website</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not include a contact form, online intake form, newsletter or advertising
        pixels. It does not ask you to submit personal health information. As with most websites,
        the hosting and network providers may process basic technical logs needed to deliver and
        protect the site, such as an IP address, request time, page requested and browser
        information.
      </p>

      <h2>Website statistics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand visits, page views, referral sources and page
        performance. It does not use analytics cookies or track individual visitors across websites.
        Your browser sends page and technical performance information to Cloudflare. We also use
        Google Search Console to understand how this website appears in Google Search. These tools
        do not give us appointment details or health-history information from Jane. Learn more about <a
          href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2>Booking through Jane</h2>
      <p>
        Booking buttons take you to Sabrina’s Jane booking site. Jane is a separate service with its
        own privacy practices. Appointment and health-history information should be entered only
        through Jane, not through this website or ordinary email.
      </p>

      <h2>Email and telephone</h2>
      <p>
        You may call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> about a time-sensitive appointment matter,
        such as running late or cancelling an appointment. For general booking questions, appointment
        requests or other non-urgent matters, please email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}
          >{site.email}</a
        >. Ordinary email and voicemail are not intended for personal health information, so please
        do not include health details in a message.
      </p>

      <h2>Text messaging consent and privacy</h2>
      <p>
        SabrinatheRMT does not send promotional or marketing text messages. Text messaging is used
        only for general conversational support, such as responding to an inquiry or addressing an
        appointment-related matter. Please do not send personal health information by text message.
      </p>
      <p>
        SabrinatheRMT may send a text message only in response to a message you send, or when you
        have separately agreed to receive a text about an appointment-related matter. Consent to
        receive text messages is not required to receive massage therapy services. Message frequency
        varies based on communication needs, and message and data rates may apply.
      </p>

      <h3>Data sharing</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Customer data is not shared with third parties for promotional or marketing purposes.
        </li>
        <li>
          Mobile opt-in and consent are never shared with anyone for any purpose. Any information
          sharing mentioned elsewhere in this policy excludes mobile opt-in data.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Messaging terms and conditions</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>
          The messaging program consists of general conversational messaging to answer questions and
          provide support to customers.
        </li>
        <li>
          You can cancel the SMS service at any time. Reply STOP to the phone number from which you
          received messages. After you send STOP, you will receive a confirmation that you have been
          unsubscribed. After that, you will not receive SMS messages from SabrinatheRMT unless
          messaging is re-enabled at your request.
        </li>
        <li>
          If you are experiencing issues with the messaging program, reply HELP for assistance or
          email
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </li>
        <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
        <li>
          Message and data rates may apply for messages sent to you from SabrinatheRMT and to
          SabrinatheRMT from you. Message frequency varies based on communication needs. Contact
          your wireless provider with questions about your text or data plan.
        </li>
        <li>
          For privacy questions, please review this policy or email
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Google Maps</h2>
      <p>
        The location maps are not loaded automatically. If you choose “Show map,” your browser
        connects to Google and Google may receive technical information about your visit. You can
        use the written addresses without loading a map.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions and accessible information</h2>
      <p>
        For a privacy question or to request this information in an accessible format, call <a
          href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a
        > or email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> without including personal health
        information in email or voicemail.
      </p>
      <p><em>Last updated: September 25, 2026.</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
